{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01VXxcTjso9mJtUUdGvYWd4m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"✓ 3.2 Implementation Complete\n- Changes made: Updated `sendNowCompeting` function to use `const maxTeams = teamCounts[config.compType] || 2;` and loop `i <= maxTeams` instead of hardcoded `i <= 6`\n- Files modified: `show-controller/src/components/GraphicsControl.jsx`\n- Bugs found: none\n\n---\n\nNow let me continue with **Task 2.2: Fix rotation button grid layout**. Looking at the file I just read, I can see line 639 has the issue:\n\n```javascript\n<div className={`grid gap-1.5 mb-2 ${rotationCount === 4 ? 'grid-cols-4' : 'grid-cols-6'}`}>\n```\n\nThis only handles 4 or 6 columns, not 7. Let me fix this:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":270,"cache_read_input_tokens":49311,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":270,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5bfe1f31-57da-47fa-9c5e-a9fed104140c","uuid":"c615c493-ef0f-408b-a087-cf82c3f1ee6d"}
